ineer – Frontend Focus (m/f/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Alpine Eagle,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;building the future of counter-drone&amp;nbsp;defence.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;a fast-growing, international deep-tech company working at the intersection of aerospace engineering,&amp;nbsp;defence&amp;nbsp;systems, and machine learning. Our goal: create the world’s first swarm-based, airborne counter-drone system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Modern conflicts show how quickly drones are reshaping the battlefield. Threats are rising, and today’s solutions&amp;nbsp;aren’t&amp;nbsp;keeping pace.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;here to change that.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
