&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Degree in Industrial Design, Mechanical Engineering, Product Design, or equivalent practical experience in hardware design.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience in physical product design, industrial design, or hardware packaging.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong proficiency in 3D CAD software (e.g., SolidWorks, Rhino, Fusion 360, or AutoCAD) for modeling physical components and spatial layouts.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proven experience designing physical enclosures, transport cases (custom inlays/foam), and managing hardware ergonomics (e.g., cable management solutions).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
