&lt;li&gt;Active contributions to open-source routing protocols (e.g., batman-adv, olsrd, Babel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A professional background at tactical mesh vendors (such as Silvus, Persistent Systems, TrellisWare, Saab, or Bittium).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mmWave backhaul systems or other technologies where directional beamforming is the default mode of operation.&lt;/li&gt;
