&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with automated test script generation or data post-processing tools (e.g., Python, MATLAB, Nominal).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
