&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Leadership Toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coordination Skills:&amp;nbsp;Proven ability to lead a technical team on-site, manage schedules, and communicate priorities clearly under pressure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Data Mastery:&amp;nbsp;Practical experience in data reduction and analysis using&amp;nbsp;MATLAB or Python.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
