&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Operations Excellence team sits within the COO organization and serves as a strategic partner to managers, team leads, and colleagues across Stark. By delivering data-driven insights, leading critical projects, and driving continuous process improvement, we help the organization operate more efficiently, scale effectively, and achieve its goals faster.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;As an individual contributor, you will take end-to-end ownership of complex initiatives with significant business impact. Working closely with cross-functional stakeholders, you will have the opportunity to influence key decisions, shape core operating processes, and contribute directly to the success of one of Europe’s fastest-growing unicorns.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As Automation Engineer, you build and deploy automations that eliminate manual effort across operations and the back-office. You work across RPA, LLM-based tooling, and API integrations — and you are as likely to be automating an invoice approval chain as a production line data feed. You measure success in hours saved and errors eliminated.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design and build RPA workflows for operational and back-office processes — UiPath, Power Automate, or equivalent&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Develop LLM-based automation tools for document-heavy workflows: invoice extraction, quality certificates, order processing, email triage&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Integrate automation solutions with ERP, MES, and business applications via APIs&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build agent-based workflows where multi-step reasoning or decision-making is required&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Test, deploy, and maintain automations in production — including monitoring, alerting, and incident response&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Document automation logic, dependencies, and maintenance procedures thoroughly&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Work with operational and back-office teams to identify, scope, and prioritise new automation opportunities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 ds-type-heading-five&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;3–6 years building automations in an operational or business process context&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Has shipped working automations into production — not just proof-of-concept or demo environments&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;RPA tools — UiPath, Power Automate, or equivalent (hands-on production experience)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Python scripting — for custom automation logic, API integration, and LLM tool use&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;API integration — REST APIs, webhooks, data exchange across ERP and business systems&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Process analysis and QA mindset — automations must be reliable, not just functional&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;BSc in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or similar&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
