&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with satellite operations, including both onboard and ground-based Fault Detection, Isolation, and Recovery (FDIR) processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with scripting languages such as Bash and Lua&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Java, C, or C++&lt;/li&gt;
