&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work hand in hand with Growth Marketing on the full D2C funnel and build processes, tooling and a scalable operating model – combining people, automation and AI – from the ground up. You report to the Managing Director Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
