<p class="isSelectedEnd">We are looking for a <strong>Senior Software Engineer (TypeScript, Next.js / Node.js) </strong>to join our <strong>Engineering </strong>team in <strong>Munich or&nbsp;working remotely from Germany</strong>.&nbsp;At Atolls, your role will play a key role in helping us provide a seamless web experience that enables users to find the Smart Shopping capability that best matches their intent through search, navigation, and a personalized home page, creating exceptional user experiences and empowering consumers to make informed and confident shopping decisions. As a key part of our team, you'll be directly involved in building and enhancing the digital destinations our users rely on throughout their shopping journeys.</p>
