<li>Strong foundation in <strong>object-oriented programming</strong> and concurrent event-based systems.</li>
<li>Advanced knowledge of <strong>TypeScript</strong>, including its environment and type system.</li>
<li>Extensive expertise in <strong>GraphQL</strong>.</li>
<li>Keen architectural mindset with an eye for <strong>application design patterns</strong>.</li>
<li>Excellent communication skills with fluency in English (written and spoken).</li>
</ul>
