<li>Working knowledge of <strong>Apollo GraphQL</strong>.</li>
<li>Experience with <strong>PHP Symfony</strong>.</li>
<li>Experience working with <strong>AWS cloud</strong>.</li>
<li>Basic understanding of <strong>SQL databases</strong> and schema-less concepts.</li>
<li>Knowledge of <strong>E2E testing</strong> (e.g., WebdriverIO, Selenium, or similar tools).</li>
