&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll ideally come from semiconductor equipment, photonics, scientific instrumentation, aerospace, medical devices or another high-tech manufacturing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;d particularly like to hear from people with experience of:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and testing complex, high-value technology products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electro-mechanical assembly and system integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Root cause analysis and structured problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing practice, quality standards and root-cause basics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reading and following technical documentation and build procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with precision mechanical and electronic components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and pride in workmanship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semiconductor equipment or semiconductor manufacturing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cleanroom working experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wiring and soldering to IPC standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with complex photonics or metrology equipment, such as optical systems, lasers, fibre optics, and precision instrumentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing engineering or process improvement exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bit about us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infinitesima is a privately owned company founded in 2001, as a spin-out of the University of Bristol, by CTO Professor Andrew Humphris. Our dynamic team of scientists and engineers is focussed on enabling the next generation of semiconductor devices through delivery of innovative products to customers around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength lies in the varied perspectives that come from different cultures, experiences, and identities. We believe that true innovation is fuelled by collaboration, locally and globally. We strive to foster an environment where everyone can contribute meaningfully and thrive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;If you require adjustments to take part in the recruitment process, please let us know, we’ll do our best to support you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
