&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Abingdon, Oxfordshire | Permanent | £27,250 - £32,250 | Full-time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
