&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated Test Manager to lead Quality Assurance for a AAA game development team. You will lead embedded testing teams, and partner with cross-functional leadership to balance quality, schedule, and risk in a complex development environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we will do together:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;QA Strategy &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define global QA strategy, test objectives, quality gates, and risk-based testing methodologies for major project milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate QA into early development planning to ensure quality is a core part of the feature lifecycle rather than just final validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;People Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop a high-performing team of QA Leads and testers, fostering a culture of ownership and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage both internal and external QA resources effectively to meet project demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Test Planning &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee comprehensive test execution across functional, gameplay, performance, stability, multiplayer, and platform certification areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor defect trends and quality risks, ensuring critical issues are prioritized and driven to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Defect &amp;amp; Risk Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze defect data to identify systemic quality issues and drive root-cause analysis and preventative initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate emerging quality risks and technical assessments clearly to Production and project leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Milestone &amp;amp; Release Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish QA schedules and deliverables for major milestones, providing objective assessments of build stability and release readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate final regression and stabilization efforts during high-pressure release periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Platform Certification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead preparation for first-party certification, coordinating test plans and tracking submission risks to ensure successful launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for quality as the senior QA representative within project leadership, balancing technical standards with production constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships across disciplines to establish a shared responsibility for quality across the entire development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;External &amp;amp; Co-Development QA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external vendors and co-development QA teams, defining expectations and reporting standards to ensure seamless integration with internal strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;QA Tools, Metrics &amp;amp; Process Improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data-driven reporting and dashboards to track build health, test coverage, and milestone progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve QA efficiency through automation, tooling, and process retrospectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in software QA with 3+ years managing teams in game development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping at least one major AAA title across the full development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in developing test strategies, risk-based testing, and Agile methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to influence senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
