&lt;li&gt;Experience with console certification, multiplayer/online services, and live-service operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Jira, TestRail, and technical QA solutions like automation and telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
