&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Consultant at Reltio plays a pivotal role in the sales process, partnering with Account Executives to understand prospective customers&#39; business challenges and to articulate the value of Reltio&#39;s cutting-edge data unification and AI-driven solutions. This individual will be responsible for developing and delivering compelling presentations and demonstrations, designing tailored solution architectures, and acting as a trusted technical advisor to prospects. The ideal candidate is passionate about data, possesses strong communication and presentation skills, and thrives in a fast-paced, innovative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the sales team to identify and qualify sales opportunities, understanding customer needs and business objectives related to data unification and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver engaging, customized product demonstrations and presentations that effectively showcase Reltio&#39;s value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and propose high-level solution architectures that address specific customer requirements and integrate with their existing technology landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver highly customized, compelling product demonstrations and proof-of-concept (POC) engagements that showcase differentiated value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to technical questions and objections from prospective &amp;amp; existing customers, providing clear and concise explanations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage technical aspects of Request for Proposals (RFPs) and Request for Information (RFIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with technical stakeholders and decision-makers within prospect/customer organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends, competitive landscape, and Reltio&#39;s product advancements in data unification and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback from the field to Product Management and Engineering teams to contribute to product enhancement and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the creation of sales tools, best practices, and re-usable assets for the pre-sales organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support marketing events, including trade shows and webinars, by delivering presentations and demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
