orks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Some experience in a client-facing, delivery, consulting, operations, analyst or similar role. Experience of technology products or projects is a plus, but you don't need to have led them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to manage expectations and give clear updates to clients and colleagues.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good problem-solving skills and the ability to break down a complex problem into clear next steps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work independently and take initiative, with a strong focus on getting things done, and the judgement to know when to ask for help.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A proactive, adaptable and hands-on mindset, willing to roll your sleeves up to solve any problem.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Resilience and empathy, staying positive and persistent through challenges while understanding the human impact of change on the people we work with.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A real appetite to learn, give and receive feedback, and grow quickly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a flat and agile organisation and plan to remain this way. We are looking for open-minded individuals who are comfortable with ambiguity and an ever-changing environment.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>⭐ Bonus points</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exposure to consulting, project delivery or technology implementations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience using data to investigate problems (e.g. SQL, spreadsheets or BI tools).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this particular role, prior experience in the energy sector is strongly preferred.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role is ideal for someone who 