us processes to manage customer and energy specialist interactions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build product features and tooling used by Kraken’s energy and support specialists to communicate with customers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solve complex real-time challenges, such as customers or specialists joining and leaving calls, connection issues and dropped calls.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Integrate Kraken’s systems with third-party communication providers, including platforms such as Twilio.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with engineers, product teams and customer-facing teams to understand problems and build effective solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help shape the technical direction of the Comms team as it grows, contributing to how the team’s focus, systems and ways of working evolve.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take ownership of projects and contribute to improving the reliability, scalability and overall experience of Kraken’s communication systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop towards a people leadership role as the Comms team continues to grow.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>What you'll need:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for someone with a general interest in technology and problem-solving; someone diligent and thoughtful.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with the following:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Python</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Django (or equiv. web framework)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">HTTP and REST APIs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Celery and async processing</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Postgres</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AWS</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Terraform, Packer, Consul</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">HTMX</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">React 