cture - how much you spend, and what you can afford to repay to build a deeper, more accurate understanding of each customer's unique financial situation.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />And we've shown it works at scale. We’ve issued over <strong>£1.3bn</strong> in loans directly to customers while delivering <strong>market-leading credit performance</strong> - for every 10 defaults the industry expects, we see only 3. We also reached profitability just 2.5 years after launch.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />Backed by <strong>£2bn+</strong> of funding from top-tier investors including Citi, GSR Ventures, and Deutsche Bank, we’re recognised as one of Europe’s fastest-growing fintechs (Sifted, CNBC). Now, we’re expanding into new markets and product lines - and we’re looking for ambitious people who want to learn fast, take ownership, and grow with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the Team</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a successful financial services enterprise that offers personal loans in the UK. Our mission is to increase access to affordable loans by looking beyond credit scores- we consider a person's earnings, spending habits and overall financial health to drive our lending decisions. We launched in March 2021 and have grown exponentially since, with further exciting plans for the future.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We pride ourselves on bringing affordable lending to the market whilst making the right decisions based on the individual rather than their credit report. Our determination, approach, and resourcefulness have set us apart from our competitors for the better.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We have an open plan office, encouraging lateral communication of different departments to bolster both individual and collective expertise, knowledge, and collaborative support, where you can apply your experience and skills to further develop and improve aspects of the business and yourself.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How we work:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shifts: Monday-Friday  (shift patterns) TBC</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">One Saturday a month- returned in Overtime or time in lieu.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bank holidays – Two bank holidays per year- returned in Overtime or time in lieu.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are seeking a highly skilled Senior Underwriter to join our team working on our Unsecured Lending product. This role offers a broad range of responsibilities, including team leadership, credit assessment, and supporting the scaling of performance and targets across the function.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be a highly valued member of the team, combining strong regulatory understanding with solid company and product knowledge to make balanced, commercially aware underwriting decisions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ideal candidate will thrive in a target-driven environment, take ownership naturally, and act proactively without needing to be asked. We are looking for someone who leads by example, brings energy to the team, and is confident in making decisions in a fast-paced lending environment.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you'll be doing:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will use top-of-the-range, in-house built technology that blends traditional lending methods with Open Banking analysis.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead from the Front. As part of the Underwriting management team, you will be a pillar for other team members and will cover TL’s in times of absence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">As we grow as people and target our processes and systems that need constant monitoring and updating, we are looking for someone who is not afraid to speak out when they see a chance to better ourselves.</p><