others.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Headquartered in Switzerland with a growing team across North America and Europe, DeepJudge is shaping the future of how professional knowledge is discovered and applied.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At DeepJudge, we move with urgency, think rigorously, and work closely with our clients to build products that solve meaningful problems. If you want to help define how AI transforms professional knowledge work, we’d love to hear from you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the role:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a Revenue Operations Manager to strengthen the systems that power our go-to-market teams.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a builder role for someone who can design, implement, and own the processes, workflows, automations, and data architecture that accelerate how we find, engage, win, onboard, retain, and expand customers at scale. You will partner across Marketing, Sales, Customer Success, and Partnership to turn fragmented systems and manual work into a high-leverage GTM engine.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you naturally think: “This should be an automated system, not a spreadsheet.” …you’ll likely be a strong fit. We would love to connect with you about enabling our rapidly growing revenue team. You will play a key role in increasing internal efficiency and productivity to support the team in creating the best customer experience, and in driving commercial success.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Your responsibilities will include:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CRM and revenue tech stack architecture</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own end-to-end <strong>CRM administration</strong> as the single source of truth for revenue activities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Manage the design, configuration, and roadmap of a connected <strong>revenue tech stack</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set and enforce <strong>data governance</strong> standards: field hygiene, deduplication, permissions, and ongoing data-quality monitoring</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automation and data foundation</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Automate</strong> and enrich the manual layer with workflows and LLMs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and maintain operational <strong>dashboards</strong> (recurring KPIs, data hygiene, system adoption)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Advise with thought leadership on which tooling we procure next as we scale</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cross-functional partnership and enablement</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Operational <strong>business partner</strong> to GTM leadership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive <strong>systems and process adoption</strong> across Marketing, Sales, Customer Success, and Partnership teams through training and enablement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as first point of contact for revenue system support tickets</p></li></ul></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What success looks like in 12 months:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">GTM signals are consistently translated into actionable workflows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sellers and customer-facing teams spend materially less time on manual admin and prep</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Critical revenue systems are connected, key workflows are AI-assisted or fully automated</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leadership has a real-time view into pipeline, conversion, execution, and customer health</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You're a great fit if you:</strong></p><