fies Land opportunities and Expand possibilities, leveraging your extended resources such as Partners, Marketing, Inside Sales, Customer Success.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build account plans that identify whitespace, map stakeholders, and set a realistic path to close.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Navigate multi-stakeholder buying committees, including technical, business, and economic buyers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and execute the full sales cycle, from prospecting through negotiation and close.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with sales engineering and customer success to build technical credibility and ensure a smooth handoff and adoption after close.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent Camunda's value to business and technical buyers, tailoring the message to what each audience actually cares about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Handle tender processes with precision, observe pipeline health with discipline, manage Forecast with accuracy.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You Will Bring to the Role</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid experience closing enterprise software deals end-to-end in DACH, with a track record across multiple full sales cycles. You know what it takes to move a deal from first meeting to signature without losing momentum.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Efficient balance between driving towards a customer vision and achieving short-term projects towards this horizon.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work in a fast-paced environment with own initiative. The playbook will not provide all answers in advance!</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort navigating multi-stakeholder enterprise environments. You've worked complex deals involving IT, business, and procurement stakeholders, and you know how to keep everyone moving in the same direction.</p></li><li><p sty