&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
