px;">Business-fluent command of German and English, both written and spoken</li></ul></p><br><strong>Look forward to:</strong><p><ul><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"><strong>Impact from Day One:</strong> A wide range of responsibilities with a high level of ownership and the opportunity to help shape processes, strategies, and products at the management level</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"><strong>Culture &amp; Team:</strong> A collaborative and supportive work environment in small, interdisciplinary teams with flat hierarchies, short decision-making paths, and a values-driven culture</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"><strong>Exciting Environment:</strong> Innovative AI-focused projects and clients who are market leaders in their respective industries</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"><strong>Growth:</strong> Individual opportunities for personal and professional development, along with targeted training and continuing education programs</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"><strong>Benefits:</strong> Attractive compensation, regular team events (lunches, offsites), BusinessBike, corporate fitness (Wellpass), as well as free drinks, fruit, and snacks in the office</li><li style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;"><strong>Top Locations:</strong> A fantastic workplace right next to the English Garden in Munich or close to Alexanderplatz in Berlin</li></ul><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Feel free to visit our <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/thenunatakgroup/?originalSubdomain=de" style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;"><span style="border:0px solid;margin:0px;">Linkedin</span></a> page to learn more about the team and everyday life at Nunatak.</span></p><br><strong>Contact</strong><p><span style="font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;">Would you like to be part of an interdisciplina